              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanja nganimyika, mpela muŵatendele Aisalaeli ŵala, ŵele ŵiŵayice ku cindu cele ciŵacikombolaga kucikwaya, ni kuti Kwitumbi lya Sinayi, lyele lilyaliji mkolela moto, lyacipi ca bii ni mbungo jamacili,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
