          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myice ku cisangalalo kwele kwasongene ŵanace ŵandanda kupagwa ŵa Mlungu, ŵagalembedwe mena gawo kwinani. Myice kwa Mlungu, jwakulamula jwa ŵandu wosope, nipo soni kwa misimu ja ŵandu ŵakulungama ŵaŵatesile Mlungu kuŵa ŵaswela kusyesyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myice kwa Yesu, Namangoswe jwakolosya ya cilanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " casambano, nipo soni myice ku miasi jiŵasulwisye jele jajikutusalila yindu yambone kupunda mujatendelaga miasi ja Abele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
